SUMMARY:Meet the Maker: Jefferson's Bourbon | Session II 
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free\nStatus: You are on Wait
 list\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/206917\n\nJoin us
  for an intimate tasting experience with Jefferson’s Bourbon\, exploring
  the craftsmanship\, character\, and creativity behind each pour. The even
 ing begins with a welcome cocktail and time to mingle before a guided tast
 ing led by Jefferson’s founder Trey Zoeller. A Kentucky native with deep
  family ties to American whiskey\, Zoeller founded Jefferson’s with his 
 father in 1997 and has become known for challenging bourbon tradition thro
 ugh inventive approaches to aging and blending\, earning him a place in th
 e Kentucky Bourbon Hall of Fame.\n\nAs straight tasting pours are passed\,
  Trey will share the story of Jefferson’s while guiding members through 
 the flavor profiles\, production process\, and distinctive character of ea
 ch selection. Following the tasting\, the evening opens back up for conver
 sation\, giving members the opportunity to mingle\, revisit their favorite
 s\, and connect with Trey one-on-one for questions and a deeper dive into 
 the world of Jefferson’s Bourbon.\n\n*This event is complimentary and re
 served for members only. Complimentary light bites and refreshments will b
 e served. We kindly ask that all cancellations be made at least 24 hours p
 rior to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/206917
CATEGORIES:Food & Beverage
